      "writtenOn": "2020-04-17T19:48:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Similar to the situation in addXor, this does make it slower, but only a tiny bit (by 0.3-2%), presumably because this is only called once every key stream.\n\nI\u0027ve changed it to\n _, _ \u003d key[KeySize-1], nonce[NonceSize-1] // bounds check elimination hint\n\nHopefully this is more readable",
      "parentUuid": "8d17bdf1_6818fc9e",
      "revId": "ee0e8efa5ab6ac3b20a446c0ed6947ee3cd5955f",
