      "writtenOn": "2020-04-17T19:48:13Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Unfortunately changing this to [:4] leads to a pretty big performance hit:\n benchmark                        old ns/op     new ns/op     delta\n BenchmarkChaCha20/64-12          129           139           +7.75%\n BenchmarkChaCha20/256-12         433           469           +8.31%\n BenchmarkChaCha20/10x25-12       769           805           +4.68%\n BenchmarkChaCha20/4096-12        433           470           +8.55%\n BenchmarkChaCha20/100x40-12      7911          8436          +6.64%\n BenchmarkChaCha20/65536-12       103723        113718        +9.64%\n BenchmarkChaCha20/1000x65-12     106253        115295        +8.51%\n\n benchmark                        old MB/s     new MB/s     speedup\n BenchmarkChaCha20/64-12          494.42       459.09       0.93x\n BenchmarkChaCha20/256-12         590.71       545.46       0.92x\n BenchmarkChaCha20/10x25-12       325.11       310.55       0.96x\n BenchmarkChaCha20/4096-12        591.66       544.52       0.92x\n BenchmarkChaCha20/100x40-12      505.65       474.15       0.94x\n BenchmarkChaCha20/65536-12       631.83       576.30       0.91x\n BenchmarkChaCha20/1000x65-12     611.75       563.77       0.92x\n\nLooking at bce debug output, it looks like doing [:4] doesn\u0027t eliminate the bounds checks somehow. Checks are inserted for doing [:4], and then all subsequent accesses to dst and src from line 26 to line 34. Somehow there are no checks for when unaligned is false.\n\nThis also lead to checks being inserted in xorKeyStreamBlocksGeneric, where addXor is called. Weirdly, calling addXor with the slicing [0:4] doesn\u0027t trigger a bounds check, but all subsequent slicings ([4:8], [8:12] etc.) do. I think the SSA prover is quite flimsy on this:\n\n .\\xor.go:19:12: Found IsSliceInBounds\n .\\xor.go:19:21: Found IsSliceInBounds\n .\\xor.go:26:18: Found IsInBounds\n .\\xor.go:27:18: Found IsInBounds\n .\\xor.go:28:18: Found IsInBounds\n .\\xor.go:29:18: Found IsInBounds\n .\\xor.go:31:6: Found IsInBounds\n .\\xor.go:32:6: Found IsInBounds\n .\\xor.go:33:6: Found IsInBounds\n .\\xor.go:34:6: Found IsInBounds\n .\\chacha_generic.go:292:9: Found IsSliceInBounds\n .\\chacha_generic.go:293:9: Found IsSliceInBounds\n .\\chacha_generic.go:294:9: Found IsSliceInBounds\n .\\chacha_generic.go:295:9: Found IsSliceInBounds\n .\\chacha_generic.go:296:9: Found IsSliceInBounds\n .\\chacha_generic.go:297:9: Found IsSliceInBounds\n .\\chacha_generic.go:298:9: Found IsSliceInBounds\n .\\chacha_generic.go:299:9: Found IsSliceInBounds\n .\\chacha_generic.go:300:9: Found IsSliceInBounds\n .\\chacha_generic.go:301:9: Found IsSliceInBounds\n .\\chacha_generic.go:302:9: Found IsSliceInBounds\n .\\chacha_generic.go:303:9: Found IsSliceInBounds\n .\\chacha_generic.go:304:9: Found IsSliceInBounds\n .\\chacha_generic.go:305:9: Found IsSliceInBounds\n .\\chacha_generic.go:306:9: Found IsSliceInBounds",
